1101
01:13:27,904 --> 01:13:30,373
[Emmett] <i>One simple condition.</i>

1102
01:13:31,741 --> 01:13:33,909
<i>You must never open
the cellar door.</i>

1103
01:13:33,910 --> 01:13:36,011
[Alyssa]
<i>I think you wanna look.</i>

1104
01:13:36,012 --> 01:13:37,713
I think you can't help yourself.

1105
01:13:37,714 --> 01:13:39,381
- [John] <i>How would Emmett know?</i>
- [Sera] W<i>e would lose everything.</i>

1106
01:13:39,382 --> 01:13:40,916
<i>Do you really want that?</i>

1107
01:13:40,917 --> 01:13:42,117
[John] <i>There's got to be
something down there, Sera.</i>

1108
01:13:42,118 --> 01:13:43,986
We're gonna find
the perfect house,

1109
01:13:43,987 --> 01:13:45,688
and we're gonna live
the life of our dreams.

1110
01:13:45,689 --> 01:13:47,723
- [Sera] <i>Yeah?</i> - [Emmett] <i>You know
what they say about old houses.</i>

1111
01:13:47,724 --> 01:13:48,991
<i>They're like people.</i>

1112
01:13:48,992 --> 01:13:51,326
They all have
their deep, dark secrets.

1113
01:13:51,327 --> 01:13:53,996
You gotta burn it down
before it's too late.

1114
01:13:53,997 --> 01:13:56,965
<i>It's not worth the price.
It will destroy you.</i>

1115
01:13:56,966 --> 01:13:59,568
- [John] <i>I'm telling you, that house is
cursed. </i>- [Sera] Y<i>ou only want to look</i>

1116
01:13:59,569 --> 01:14:00,736
<i>because you're being asked
not to.</i>

1117
01:14:00,737 --> 01:14:02,437
Prior owner, uh, Paul MacManus.

1118
01:14:02,438 --> 01:14:04,907
- [John] Paul MacManus?
- [clerk] Paul MacManus.

1119
01:14:04,908 --> 01:14:07,643
<i>Called him a bunch of times,
but he never picked it up.</i>

1120
01:14:07,644 --> 01:14:10,814
[tense music playing]

1121
01:14:32,936 --> 01:14:36,105
[tense music continues]

1122
01:14:40,409 --> 01:14:41,409
[brake creaks]

1123
01:14:45,715 --> 01:14:46,883
[knock on door]

1124
01:14:49,753 --> 01:14:50,954
[Paul coughs]

1125
01:14:51,788 --> 01:14:52,821
[music ends]

1126
01:14:52,822 --> 01:14:54,090
It is you.

1127
01:14:55,424 --> 01:14:56,425
Can I come in?

1128
01:15:01,731 --> 01:15:03,666
- I'm sorry.
- [door closes]

1129
01:15:03,667 --> 01:15:06,234
- I'm going through a divorce.
- It's...

1130
01:15:06,235 --> 01:15:08,403
[Paul] It's hard to concentrate
